      "formula": "d(t+1h) = clamp(d(t) + P - E, 0, surface_storage_mm); E = evap_coeff * VPD(T_surface, RH) * (1 + 0.54 * wind_m_s), T_surface = T_air + surface_sun_excess_c * (1 - cloud/100); P is Open-Meteo's preceding-hour precipitation",
      "params": {
